WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.200
Look up at the sky, then look at the flowing stream.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:10.500
The sun warms the water and turns some of it into invisible vapor.

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:16.200
The vapor rises high and gathers to make clouds.

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:21.700
Clouds bring rain, and the water returns to Earth. Water keeps traveling!
